{"availability":"available","full":"pavansky/fab-dispatch","name":"fab-dispatch","description":"The right engineer to every tool-down, in real time: five allocation strategies (greedy → PyVRP) compared live, a grounded AI assistant, live dispatch. FastAPI + React.","category":"Business","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-01T10:41:47Z","updated":"2026-10-12T03:16:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://fab-dispatch.vercel.app","topics":["ai-assistant","fastapi","manufacturing","operations-research","optimization","pyvrp","qdrant","rag","react","scheduling","semiconductor","supabase","vehicle-routing","vercel"],"demo":"https://fab-dispatch.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:34.899Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:34.899Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:34.899Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:45:52.755Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:19:53.359Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T04:26:31.817Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T07:59:34.899Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The right engineer to every tool-down, in real time.","A resource allocation engine for semiconductor fab maintenance: five strategies, from a one-pass greedy to a state-of-the-art vehicle-routing solver, compared live, with every decision explained.","[]( []( []( []( [](CHANGELOG.md) [](#testing) [](LICENSE)"],"features":["Five strategies, one engine. Greedy, Hungarian (Kuhn-Munkres in rounds), regret-2 insertion,","ALNS, and PyVRP iterated local search. All share one constraint engine and cost function, so comparisons are fair. An exact MILP solver measures each heuristic's true optimality gap.","Recommendations that refuse false positives. The default \"best value\" goal never trades away","bottleneck coverage. It treats cost differences inside a noise margin as ties and then picks the fastest plan. Benchmark verdicts use paired bootstrap 95% confidence intervals.","Any fab, no code changes. Floor plan, tool families, fault catalogue, shift pattern and planning"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pavansky/fab-dispatch/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"baf954901979dd2f31979c91cad305c2d50bf9af8553d60b32f62ff040f848d9","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:35.024Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:35.024Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The right engineer to every tool-down, in real time.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pavansky/fab-dispatch/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"run.py checks your versions, installs what's missing (once), starts the API and the UI together and opens Click Continue as Dispatcher (a local one-click sign-in; the server refuses it in production).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pavansky/fab-dispatch/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No accounts, API keys, Docker or paid services: locally it uses SQLite (backend/data/) and an in-memory vector index.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pavansky/fab-dispatch/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"baf954901979dd2f31979c91cad305c2d50bf9af8553d60b32f62ff040f848d9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pavansky/fab-dispatch/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:35.025Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T03:16:05Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pavansky/fab-dispatch/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:35.029Z","hash":"baf954901979dd2f31979c91cad305c2d50bf9af8553d60b32f62ff040f848d9","originalBytes":42449,"storedBytes":42449,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:34.899Z","subjects":["Automotive","Chatbots & assistants","Maths & algorithms"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Business","subjects":["Automotive","Chatbots & assistants","Maths & algorith